:: day2_tower_hub [nobr]
<<locationImage "moonspire_tower" "Moonspire Tower">>
<h2>🌙 Moonspire Tower</h2>
<p>White stone. Narrow windows. The faint electric hum of ambient magic. The room behind you is already a little less yours.</p>

<<if $d1_npc_nara and not $d2f_npc_nara_farewell>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "nara" "Nara">>
  <h4>🎵 Three Notes at the Bottom of the Stairs</h4>
  <p>A music box, still broken, still playing its fragment of melody. She's holding something small, wrapped in cloth.</p>
  [[Go down → |day2_npc_nara_farewell]]
</div>
<<else>>
  <p class="empty-note">Nothing more to do here. Ilara has said her piece. The bridge is waiting.</p>
<</if>>

